event: response.reasoning_summary_text.done
data: {"type":"response.reasoning_summary_text.done","sequence_number":94,"item_id":"rs_06cd5485f0b8e658016aca0faa833481948153e6c6c21542dc","output_index":0,"summary_index":0,"text":"**Addressing live synchronization**\n\nI'm working on implementing live synchronization for pages using API polling and refresh features while keeping the filters intact. It seems that feedback indicated some expected tasks are missing points in a stale destination, which is problematic. I might need to reset the project selection when a task row is edited. If the destination resets during earlier edits, I have to ensure row editing controls are preserved. It’s essential to keep draft destination selections consistent across renders and sync open pages effectively."}

